# Web4 Autonomous Quantitative Trading Desk — Optional Environment Variables
# Copy to `.env` for local overrides (NEVER commit `.env` or real keys).
#
# IMPORTANT: Web4 runs strictly in simulated paper-trading mode (`PaperAccount`).
# NO exchange API keys, brokerage credentials, or wallet private keys are required or supported.

# Optional: St. Louis Fed (FRED) API key for live HY credit-spread macro radar.
# If omitted, Web4 gracefully falls back to Yahoo Finance VIX + default credit-spread baseline.
FRED_API_KEY=your_optional_fred_api_key_here

# Optional: SEC EDGAR compliant User-Agent header (required by SEC fair-access policy
# if you want live 8-K / 10-Q XBRL filing gates enabled).
# Format: "AppName/Version (contact@example.com)"
SEC_USER_AGENT=Web4PaperDesk/1.0 (your-contact@example.com)

# Optional: Set to 1 to disable ANSI color codes in the terminal dashboard (`dashboard.py`).
# NO_COLOR=1
